    ],
    "comment": "RP-AXE = the exact mod set of the curated 'perfect environment' test instance. depends lists EVERY installed module (81: 57 user-requested + 24 CKAN-resolved transitive, incl. MakingHistory-DLC + BreakingGround-DLC), so installing RP-AXE reproduces that stack verbatim. Regenerated from Instance/CKAN/registry.json; no version pins (latest mutually-compatible). Conflicts with RP-1 (RP-AXE replaces the RP-1 career plugin).",
